would be more specific than "nu".  Also, are you really discovering the
answer or just looking for one?  In that case, "sisku" might be better than
"facki". Also, Pierre, formally speaking, the X2 of facki is a fact (du'u).
Not 100% sure "lo danfu" belongs there, although I suppose it could be.
